this is his kid, too?

16
00:00:36,789 --> 00:00:38,919
(Bernadette:)He's just trying
to be supportive.

17
00:00:38,924 --> 00:00:40,694
(Howard:)Just supportive.

18
00:00:40,692 --> 00:00:42,692
